# Core (always)

Canonical detail: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Architecture deep-dive: [docs/architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md).

## Non-negotiables

- Tailwind utilities + semantic tokens only (`text-text-primary`, not `text-gray-900`)
- Content from `cv.json` / `@cv` — never hardcode personal data
- Interactive UI via `<Button>` (`href` → link; omit → button)
- Client scripts: `astro:page-load`, never `DOMContentLoaded`
- Package manager: **pnpm** only
- Theme: light/dark toggle (`ThemeToggle`), not dark-only

## Done means CI green

```bash
pnpm run format:check && pnpm run lint && pnpm run test && pnpm run build && pnpm run test:build-urls
```

If `format:check` fails: `pnpm run format` then re-check. Dep changes → also `pnpm audit --audit-level=high`.
